    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability.Now let me compile-check the test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version improves understandability by renaming the BOM fields (`BOM_SINGLE_BYTE`, `BOM_TWO_BYTES`, `BOM_THREE_BYTES`) to convey their byte-count structure, adding a class-level Javadoc explaining the test's purpose, using `@DisplayName` for clearer test reporting, and expanding the assertion messages to describe exactly what each assertion verifies."
    }
